-- Deploy the typed DNS adapter before applying this data-only catalog migration.
-- One exact name and one requested record type per purchase. Existing MX/RDAP
-- contracts, historical prices, provider identity and billing remain unchanged.
-- New endpoints inherit the existing MX tariff; no automatic eight-call bundle.
-- Raw free Google DNS responses were captured on 2026-10-07; these are sample
-- validation evidence, not a claim of continuous upstream availability.
